{"id":1749526,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-15T11:41:13.362Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749526,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Khabar Dari Casablanca","overview":"# Translation  The story of a married couple, Farhan and Nadia, who live in Casablanca, Morocco. There, Farhan works as a pilot. They later receive the good news that Nadia is pregnant, and this joyful news is shared with their respective families in Malaysia—En. Zul and Zaleha, Farhan's family, and Datuk Iskandar and Datin Amnah, Nadia's family. Farhan is shocked when Nadia decides to return to Malaysia, and Farhan reluctantly has to allow her. It is certainly good news for Filzah, who has long harbored feelings for Farhan, to take revenge on Nadia, even though she has married Amir and has a son named Edham. Filzah's act of pretending to be close with Nadia becomes so convincing that Nadia does not suspect her evil intentions at all. Not long after arriving in her homeland, Nadia and her family are shocked by news that the plane piloted by Farhan has crashed, and the search for the wreckage and bodies fails because it is feared to be buried by sandstorms.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/5d3YESiaBxmEJPqwzOTPGm2iSMV.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2017-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Khabar Dari Casablanca","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1109288,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Remy Ishak","original_name":"Remy Ishak","popularity":0.7333,"profile_path":"/4bMvXJaCNXtF2xmji1xXqYmSoxI.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7f45e024cd632e012d3477","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1205097,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Uqash